Error [E0510]: Reading `Secret.bytes` exposes secret key material
  --> crypto_secret_bytes_exposure.jet:6:20
    |
  6 |     print("{secret.bytes}")
    |                    ^^^^^
 Why: Secret-bearing values cannot be printed, interpolated, or read as raw bytes outside an audited expert gate
 Fix: Keep the value inside `crypto` operations, or call `expert.secret_bytes(value)` inside `#Unsafe("reason") { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0510
